{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217110/extras/412d5c97d17a6e4441f2a802061f9c39.poster.avif?t=1775353088\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217110/extras/412d5c97d17a6e4441f2a802061f9c39.webm?t=1775353088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217110/extras/412d5c97d17a6e4441f2a802061f9c39.mp4?t=1775353088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial Crown is a roguelike deckbuilder about using equipment to flexibly change the contents of your deck. Instead of drafting cards after a fight, you draft equipment. Your equipment can be freely swapped between every battle, giving you the ability to counter specific threats and change your gameplan completely from one fight to the next. Your opponents will feature their own cohesive decks with different strengths and weaknesses. Experiment with different builds to take advantage of the dynamic deckbuilding system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217110/extras/062ecd0f2a951aa4e41c32643a8b08b3.poster.avif?t=1775353088\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217110/extras/062ecd0f2a951aa4e41c32643a8b08b3.webm?t=1775353088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217110/extras/062ecd0f2a951aa4e41c32643a8b08b3.mp4?t=1775353088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different characters </p></